{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "89281128b0fbafe40731d12a4adb049df4c8e0f57ae06aa8630040b072a034cb", "ja": "（先日の紅白ライブは大盛況で終わった。\n梅をバックに歌う静香のステージ、印象的だったな）", "zh": "（前几天的红白演出圆满落幕。静香以梅花为背景登台歌唱的样子，令人印象深刻啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "d1f71e7919af9a6b8173737bb37cdba9a5c5d75b90362f3d538da971391d7d63", "ja": "あの……{$P$}？\nひとりで笑ったりして、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}？\n您一个人在笑，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8f6455d0ef00dfce562e36a3b91239cbc8dec124ee6976c830aee4cca2ff7ae8", "ja": "あ、ごめん。この前のライブを思い出してたんだ。\n静香、すごくいい顔をしていたなと思って。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。我刚才想起了之前的演唱会。\n想着静香当时的表情真好看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "b17588c100acab4dc648909a1c3cd2865e5fca2270c2733bac2c3cfe45ebdca5", "ja": "いい顔……あの、参考までに聞きたいんですけど。\n私、どんな表情で歌っていたんですか？", "zh": "很好的表情……那个，我想顺便问一下作为参考。\n我唱歌的时候，到底是什么表情啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "bee18545a6097c6abc3d2eba8a71900a830de3aad69f69536294440b32ccb0fc", "ja": "{$P$}が笑っているっていうことは、\nその。何か、変だったのかなって……。", "zh": "{$P$}在笑，也就是说……那个，我就在想，是不是哪里有点奇怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5e181456ec591fb76ab3f388e2e643adf3293a1299df344f88e6ce2668343a2a", "ja": "いや、変じゃなかったよ。明るい可愛さの中に、\n可憐さや儚さもあって……大人っぽかったと思う。", "zh": "不，很正常。明朗可爱的感觉中，还带着几分惹人怜爱和梦幻感……我觉得挺成熟的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "945d06a36e67f9587c0477054d633a15d38aae6a250220f98bf76bd93e0272d2", "ja": "あの。……それって、\n普段は子どもっぽいってことですか？", "zh": "那个……也就是说，\n平时的我很孩子气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ce36e93da2717d5868e1f8f6cb74e106351099386478e021049378a333ef6bf4", "ja": "そうじゃなくて、\nいつも以上に大人っぽくて良かったってことだ。", "zh": "不是那个意思，而是说你比平时更有大人的魅力，很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "0ce7809514524239594c8a4cf32828fdaabfca64b65ba3f79ba8c4b5fa906441", "ja": "なんだか、言い訳みたいにも聞こえますけど……。\nまあ、そういうことにしておきます。", "zh": "总觉得听起来有点像是在找借口……  \n算了，就当是这么回事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "0dbdf30dbde4b590ba385fc36c26cd5973b37a2c78ab16412d1a8cff8f112312", "ja": "それに、ライブが楽しかったのは本当ですし。\n梅の香りがすると、あの時のことを思い出します。", "zh": "而且，演唱会开心是真的。\n一闻到梅花的香气，就会想起那时候的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1010_p", "source_sha256": "87b4fc0e9fd50df511496ce6ef90ddd285166c1883b07c1f0f822858dd77caaa", "ja": "香りは、その場所でないと体感できないしな。\n五感で感じる、いいステージになったと思う。", "zh": "香气只有在那个地方才能亲身感受到。感觉这是一个能用五感来感受的精彩舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "347289ad8cf637f45c2907f2239b39bd527f34362f49bec32830dd292eeaacad", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、画面越しだけじゃ伝わらない、\n静香の魅力を感じ取ってくれたはずだ。", "zh": "粉丝们也一定感受到了只有亲临现场才能体会到的、静香的魅力，而不只是隔着屏幕感受到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "8992a74b752a78321934ad1dda63bad60d00fdc25dce762e35155dcc7a299631", "ja": "そうですね。そうだといいんですけど。\n私が梅の花に感じた、鮮やかさ……。", "zh": "是啊。要是能这样就好了。\n我从梅花中感受到的那份鲜明……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "b825355c2690a3a233cec195de7ab0a79c382807670f84795f05ec549e6ad221", "ja": "見てくれた人が、同じように私を感じてくれたら……\n日ごろのがんばりが、報われたってことですよね。", "zh": "如果看过的人，也能像我一样有所感受的话……\n平日里的努力，就算没有白费吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "42985b80cde781336ddc741015e7aa04d14ee7d0e58fb50f734831bb1d038719", "ja": "なんて……梅の花と同じようになんて、\nちょっと図々しかったですね。", "zh": "我居然说……想让看过的人也感受到和梅花一样的我，真是有点太不自量力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1015_p", "source_sha256": "08a437ae2a2c549df46822b91aa3ba8fd2e31fa849ffd83133e515fd34f613d9", "ja": "いや、いいんじゃないか？\n今回のライブの成功は、静香のおかげだからな！", "zh": "不，挺好的不是吗？\n这次演出能成功，多亏了静香啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "0d58cb7eaeb7758612d6e9707fc82d0051a3eb37ef90751f41de0f53b5889565", "ja": "今日は、やけにほめるんですね？\nあんまり言われると、逆に怪しく感じますけど……。", "zh": "今天怎么一直夸我？\n被夸得太多，反而让我觉得有点可疑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0173_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "b7bd6150a0fef5c36e88c45e2a8aaf22dc01193af19448f6d04cbc01033a2495", "ja": "でも、今日のところは素直に受け取っておきます。\nありがとうございました、{$P$}。", "zh": "不过，今天我就先坦然接受了。谢谢您，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
